{"data":[{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113198474762289152"]},"author_id":"1685620377941364736","created_at":"2026-10-22T09:19:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113198488242749679"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/3yJeS7GWIL","end":165,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/zhishuzengzhang/status/2113198488242749679/photo/1","media_key":"3_2113198474762289152","start":142,"url":"https://t.co/3yJeS7GWIL"},{"display_url":"x.com/zhishuzengzhan…","end":189,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/zhishuzengzhang/status/2113088761865318660","start":166,"url":"https://t.co/9Tu3U2BzSB"}]},"id":"2113198488242749679","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":774,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"在市场全面看涨时做空\n 市场的陷阱无处不在——多头陷阱是空头的天堂。卖点恰恰藏在共识最浓的地方。\n \n为什么敢空：全面看涨时做空，不是逆势逞英雄，是结构给出了卖点，只是执行。\n\n 全面看涨=流动性最好=对手盘最厚=空头最舒服的入场时机。\n\n 市场从不奖励合群，只奖励看对且敢干的人。 https://t.co/3yJeS7GWIL https://t.co/9Tu3U2BzSB","url":"https://x.com/zhishuzengzhang/status/2113198488242749679"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112850484231077888"]},"author_id":"1592938896161001472","created_at":"2026-10-21T10:16:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112850512043536618"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/SdBpkPqOB6","end":167,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2112850512043536618/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112850484231077888","start":144,"url":"https://t.co/SdBpkPqOB6"}]},"id":"2112850512043536618","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":54,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"站在纯交易的角度\n价格只有当下，当下只有价格\n老美中期选举临近\n市场多空博弈争夺战上演\n10月操盘手训练营报名进行中~\n今晚19:00全网缠论公开课\n缠论拆解当下走势分类与买卖点\n锁定每周一三五免费公开课\n直播地址：微博关注《高山说缠论》\n点关注不迷路~\n\nbitcoin:native https://t.co/SdBpkPqOB6","url":"https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2112850512043536618"},{"author_id":"1685620377941364736","created_at":"2026-10-22T08:42:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113189264192417876"],"id":"2113189264192417876","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":13182,"like_count":15,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"text":"几十亿爆仓，死在所谓基本面的\"正确\"之上\n \n光模块双雄暴跌，江浙私募几十亿强平。\n鳄鱼不怜悯浅滩挣扎的猎物，只在血流最浓处张嘴。\n \n基本面——上半年三家龙头净利224亿、订单排到2027\n\n所有人坐同一条船，船一晃，先掉下去的是杠杆最重的那批。","url":"https://x.com/zhishuzengzhang/status/2113189264192417876"},{"author_id":"118838969","created_at":"2026-10-21T14:52:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112920079046254687"],"id":"2112920079046254687","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":17312,"like_count":23,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":7},"text":"曾于2015年发表“中国崩溃论” 美知名中国问题专家、乔治·华盛顿大学教授兼中国政策项目主任沈大伟获10月19日获中国人民外交学会副会长耿爽接待。这是中国官方时隔11年再次公开接待沈大伟，被视为双方关系解冻的信号。","url":"https://x.com/HuPing1/status/2112920079046254687"},{"author_id":"118838969","created_at":"2026-10-21T14:43:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112917705464406177"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/dyw1968316/sta…","end":156,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/dyw1968316/status/2112741163950112856","start":133,"url":"https://t.co/rTiYEeZ1Us"}]},"id":"2112917705464406177","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":9868,"like_count":17,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":4},"text":"沈大伟在2015年发文“中国崩溃论”，不过他在2016年就变调了。有人整理了我在那段时间发的文章，在2017年11月16日发在《无忧资讯》上，题为“江泽民面斥王岐山：党的形象还要不要？”转录如下：\n2015年3月，被誉为“美国最有影响力的中国问题专家”第二人的乔治 https://t.co/rTiYEeZ1Us","url":"https://x.com/HuPing1/status/2112917705464406177"},{"author_id":"1832433350390509570","created_at":"2026-10-20T23:54:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112693929678361011"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/decohere_here/…","end":113,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/decohere_here/status/2112458523301085360","start":90,"url":"https://t.co/2o4yEMslfM"}]},"id":"2112693929678361011","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":344,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":2},"text":"补充解释一下前面提到的「三十年」。\n\n这是陈苏镇在新书《汉政与王道》中提出的一种解释。《论语》说「如有王者，必世而后仁」，一世为三十年，而汉武帝恰好在即位第三十一年举行泰山封禅。 https://t.co/2o4yEMslfM","url":"https://x.com/decohere_here/status/2112693929678361011"},{"author_id":"2042909540102877184","created_at":"2026-10-22T19:29:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113352168866762792"],"id":"2113352168866762792","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":104,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"很多人一直看不懂三国演义最诡异的一幕：\n\n赵云长坂坡七进七出拼死抢出阿斗，刘备一把接过来狠狠摔在地上，赵云为何眼眶通红、泪水打转？\n\n那不是感动，那是心疼亲儿子。","url":"https://x.com/Yudian_Zero/status/2113352168866762792"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112704685207658496"]},"author_id":"1786121413767938048","created_at":"2026-10-21T00:37:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112704772486877503"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/hcaWFOR48G","end":159,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/Tylertruthfx/status/2112704772486877503/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112704685207658496","start":136,"url":"https://t.co/hcaWFOR48G"}]},"id":"2112704772486877503","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":594,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"虚云老和尚（十一）：六十七岁，他进京为全国寺院请命\n\n1906年，虚云六十七岁。\n\n上一年年底，他还在南洋。\n\n云南僧众来电，说政府正在提取寺产；寄禅和尚也来电催他赶快回国。\n\n于是这一年春天，虚云启程回国。\n\n船先经过台湾，他参访灵泉寺；随后又到了日本，参观当地佛寺。 https://t.co/hcaWFOR48G","url":"https://x.com/Tylertruthfx/status/2112704772486877503"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2112783353313439744"]},"author_id":"3353223123","created_at":"2026-10-21T06:02:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112786485917438443"],"entities":{"hashtags":[{"end":143,"start":135,"tag":"Trading"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/tZ7rqiGy6f","end":167,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/Paris13Jeanne/status/2112786485917438443/video/1","media_key":"13_2112783353313439744","start":144,"url":"https://t.co/tZ7rqiGy6f"}]},"id":"2112786485917438443","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":87,"impression_count":13433,"like_count":128,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":43,"retweet_count":14},"text":"《缠论已量化》第一期\n很多朋友都说缠论难学\n人类社