\n\n办佛教学校。\n\n组织布道团。\n\n甚至筹办医院等慈善事业。","url":"https://x.com/Tylertruthfx/status/2112939870087970839"},{"author_id":"793840805525893121","created_at":"2026-10-22T02:23:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113093770677989798"],"id":"2113093770677989798","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":9,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我遇到很多大V说自己是量化交易员，说缠论无用让早日脱离苦海。这些人都是自己没看懂书里的级别，还搞什么量化？岂不是亏更多吗？缠论教你的就是一整套思路让你进市场有严格的界定，没有这些标准绝不能买。一旦标准成立，买了就要等到卖点卖。所以成功率应该是99%，除非你自己不懂。","url":"https://x.com/manonbezos/status/2113093770677989798"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113081427667628032"]},"author_id":"1910907485554462720","created_at":"2026-10-22T01:34:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113081438061080941"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/4J1vV91c35","end":176,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/Cycle_King1913/status/2113081438061080941/photo/1","media_key":"3_2113081427667628032","start":153,"url":"https://t.co/4J1vV91c35"},{"display_url":"x.com/Cycle_King1913…","end":200,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/Cycle_King1913/status/2111756204213207477","start":177,"url":"https://t.co/ksDzuJ4Z81"}]},"id":"2113081438061080941","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":1672,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":2},"text":"一涨就追，一跌就慌？\n先别急，你可能把“一步回头”，当成了“整段掉头”。\n\n花姐带路，100天搞懂缠论｜DAY 05：线段\n\n说人话就是：\n笔像走一步，线段像走一段路。\n走路会有进有退，看方向，不能只盯着眼前那一步。\n\n今天记住三句话：\n\n三笔是起步，不是数到三就结束。\n起始要重叠，不是随便三笔都能连。 https://t.co/4J1vV91c35 https://t.co/ksDzuJ4Z81","url":"https://x.com/Cycle_King1913/status/2113081438061080941"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113331755226992640","3_2113331787611156480"]},"author_id":"1539246618452668416","created_at":"2026-10-22T18:09:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113331991387263366"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":78,"id":"3353223123","start":64,"username":"Paris13Jeanne"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/iHYj6Ikta2","end":102,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/0nebcher/status